('116.16.b.2.A',3,'Transferring body weight means you shift your weight...','["from one friend to another", "from one planet to another", "from one book to another", "from one body part to another"]'::jsonb,3,'Weight transfers from hands to feet and back.','original'),
('116.16.b.2.A',3,'Moving over a low bench with good control means you...','["plan your steps and balance", "fall", "close your eyes", "rush"]'::jsonb,0,'Control requires planning.','original'),
