('116.16.b.6.A',3,'A lead-up game is a game that...','["has no rules", "is only for adults", "is not fun", "teaches skills used in a full sport"]'::jsonb,3,'Lead-up games prepare you for full sports.','original'),
('116.16.b.6.A',3,'A basic strategy in a team game is to...','["spread out to create space", "stand together", "stand still", "ignore the ball"]'::jsonb,0,'Spreading out helps passing.','original'),
