('116.16.b.8.A',3,'Regular physical activity improves your overall...','["stress", "health and wellness", "nothing", "boredom"]'::jsonb,1,'Activity benefits the whole body.','original'),
('116.16.b.8.B',3,'Frequency in a fitness plan is how often you...','["sleep", "eat", "exercise each week", "rest"]'::jsonb,2,'Frequency is the number of times.','original'),
('116.16.b.8.B',3,'Intensity in endurance activities is...','["how long the class is", "your shoe size", "your height", "how hard you work"]'::jsonb,3,'Intensity is effort.','original'),
('116.16.b.8.C',3,'Which is a health-related fitness component?','["muscular strength", "bat speed", "dance style", "ball color"]'::jsonb,0,'Strength is a health-related component.','original'),
('116.16.b.8.C',3,'Agility is a skill-related component that means you can...','["lift heavy things", "change direction quickly", "stretch far", "hold your breath"]'::jsonb,1,'Agility is quick changes of direction.','original'),
('116.16.b.8.C',3,'Cardiorespiratory endurance is the ability of your heart and lungs to...','["sleep", "rest", "supply oxygen during long activity", "stop working"]'::jsonb,2,'It measures stamina.','original'),
('116.16.b.9.A',3,'A good personal fitness goal is one that is...','["forgotten", "impossible", "vague", "specific and measurable"]'::jsonb,3,'Clear goals are easier to reach.','original'),
