('116.16.b.10.A',3,'Eating a balanced meal before a game helps your body by...','["slowing you down", "giving you energy to perform", "making you sleepy", "giving you a headache"]'::jsonb,1,'Good nutrition supports performance.','original'),
('116.16.b.10.A',3,'Which snack helps performance after practice?','["soda", "cake", "fruit and yogurt", "candy only"]'::jsonb,2,'Protein and carbs help recovery.','original'),
('116.16.b.10.B',3,'You should drink water...','["only before", "never", "only after", "before, during, and after activity"]'::jsonb,3,'Stay hydrated all the time.','original'),
('116.16.b.11.A',3,'Choosing proper attire independently means you...','["pick the right clothes and gear for the activity", "skip gear", "ask for help every time", "wear whatever"]'::jsonb,0,'Independent choices show responsibility.','original'),
('116.16.b.11.B',3,'Applying cycling safety means you always...','["ride with no hands", "wear a helmet and obey signals", "ride at night without lights", "skip stop signs"]'::jsonb,1,'Helmets and rules prevent injuries.','original'),
('116.16.b.11.B',3,'When riding a scooter, you should...','["ride barefoot", "ride in traffic", "wear a helmet and knee pads", "ride with a friend on your lap"]'::jsonb,2,'Pads protect against falls.','original'),
('116.16.b.12.A',3,'Taking responsibility for your actions means you...','["blame others", "deny", "hide", "admit your mistakes"]'::jsonb,3,'Responsibility is honesty about actions.','original'),
