('116.16.b.12.C',3,'During a hard game, a self-management skill is to...','["throw the ball", "take a deep breath and stay calm", "quit", "yell at the referee"]'::jsonb,1,'Calming strategies manage emotions.','original'),
('116.16.b.13.A',3,'A socially acceptable way to resolve a conflict is to...','["yell", "ignore", "talk it out calmly", "fight"]'::jsonb,2,'Talking resolves problems.','original'),
('116.16.b.13.A',3,'Responding to a loss with dignity means you...','["walk away angry", "cry and blame others", "cheat", "congratulate the winners"]'::jsonb,3,'Good sportsmanship includes graciousness.','original'),
